Start
Input a number
If the number is 0, set the count to 1
Otherwise, set the digit count to 0
Divide the number by 10
Increase the digit count by 1
Repeat steps 5–6 until the number becomes 0
Display the number of digits (count)
If the digit count is 1, print single-digit number
If the digit count is 2, print double-digit number
If the digit count is 3, print triple-digit number
If the digit count is greater than 3, print four-digit or more number
Stop.
